<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs weak/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs weak/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were weak to $0.50 lower. Demand was moderate to light. Top $49.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 47.50-48.50, mostly 48.00-48.50, some 49.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $1.00. Top $51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs.  39.00-44.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs.  44.00-46.50</p>
<p>		500-600 lbs.  46.50-49.00</p>
<p>		few over 600 lbs.  49.00-50.00, few 51.00</p>
</text>
